			"versionNonce": 2103772098,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1779011435867,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "R Ratio = (ALT/ULN)/(ALP/ULN)\n  R>5 = Hepatocellular\n  R 2-5 = Mixed\n  R<2 = Cholestatic\n\nRUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts?\n  YES: Extrahepatic (stones, malignancy) ->\nMRCP or ERCP\n  NO: Intrahepatic\n  -> Hemodynamic assess\n  -> Medication review\n  -> Sepsis cholestasis\n  -> TPN >2 weeks",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "R Ratio = (ALT/ULN)/(ALP/ULN)\n  R>5 = Hepatocellular\n  R 2-5 = Mixed\n  R<2 = Cholestatic\n\nRUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts?\n  YES: Extrahepatic (stones, malignancy) -> MRCP or ERCP\n  NO: Intrahepatic\n  -> Hemodynamic assess\n  -> Medication review\n  -> Sepsis cholestasis\n  -> TPN >2 weeks",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "R Ratio = (ALT/ULN)/(ALP/ULN)\n  R>5 = Hepatocellular\n  R 2-5 = Mixed\n  R<2 = Cholestatic\n\nRUQ Ultrasound:\n- Dilated ducts?\n  YES: Extrahepatic (stones, malignancy) -> MRCP or ERCP\n  NO: Intrahepatic\n  -> Hemodynamic assess\n  -> Medication review\n  -> Sepsis cholestasis\n  -> TPN >2 weeks",
			"link": null
		},
