			"updated": 1779011435867,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "PROGNOSIS: TBili = independent predictor of CV death + HF hospitalization (HFrEF)\neven after NT-proBNP adjustment. Independent predictor of RV failure post-LVAD.\nSacubitril/valsartan reduced TBili 2.4% vs enalapril (PARADIGM-HF, Suzuki 2020)",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "PROGNOSIS: TBili = independent predictor of CV death + HF hospitalization (HFrEF)\neven after NT-proBNP adjustment. Independent predictor of RV failure post-LVAD.\nSacubitril/valsartan reduced TBili 2.4% vs enalapril (PARADIGM-HF, Suzuki 2020)",
			"autoResize": true,
