			"updated": 1779011435868,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Broader DDx:\n- DILI\n- Viral hepatitis ALT:LDH >1.5\n- Autoimmune hepatitis\n- Ischemic with partial\nrecovery\n- Sepsis\n\nWorkup:\n- ALT:LDH ratio\n- Hepatitis panel\n- ANA, ASMA\n- Med review",
			"fontSize": 12.357219468215431,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Broader DDx:\n- DILI\n- Viral hepatitis ALT:LDH >1.5\n- Autoimmune hepatitis\n- Ischemic with partial recovery\n- Sepsis\n\nWorkup:\n- ALT:LDH ratio\n- Hepatitis panel\n- ANA, ASMA\n- Med review",
