			"text": "PROGNOSIS (SURVIVE): Elevated transaminases -> 31-day mortality 17.6% vs 8.4%;\n180-day mortality 31.6% vs 22.4% in ADHF. Associated with hypoperfusion signs.\n[Nikolaou 2013]",
